+# Transfer or deposit to USDC (Perps) missing
 Situation 1: Transferred 1,000 from USDC (Spot) to USDC (Perps). When I checked, I see <1,000 USDC in my Available Balance. Where did it go?
 Situation 2: Deposited 1,000 USDC from Arbitrum, and the deposit was successful. When I checked, I see <1,000 USDC in my Available Balance. Where did it go?
-Reasoning
-If you have open positions on cross margin with negative unrealized P&L, your deposits and Spot to Perp transfers will go toward collateral for those open positions. Please refer to the Docs to understand how margining works:
-https://hyperliquid.gitbook.io/hyperliquid-docs/trading/margining#unrealized-pnl-and-transfer-margin-requirements
